Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Read the checkpoint folder from SHVLA_SMOLVLA_DIR

what:     every hard-coded `/app/models/smolvla_base` on a run path becomes
          os.environ.get("SHVLA_SMOLVLA_DIR", "/app/models/smolvla_base"): MODELS in frontend/smolvla_e2e.py;
          the vision_s1024 / vision_out_seed cache paths and the two --ckpt defaults of frontend/smolvla.py;
          the two defaults of frontend/smolvla_expert.py (prepare); the --ckpt default of frontend/smolvla_expert_ref.py;
          tests/gvsoc/run.py (vision-cost and prefix-cost npz paths, the --npz default); tests/gvsoc/expert.py (--npz).
why:      /app/models does not exist here; one variable per run selects the checkpoint folder (published or LIBERO).
evidence: grep -rn '"/app/models/smolvla_base' --include=*.py after the patch: only tests/gvsoc/flow_tables.py:52,
          tests/gvsoc/ttt.py:290 and tools/e2e/*.py remain (not on any run.sh path, left unchanged).
upstream: yes (default unchanged when the variable is unset).
applies-to: softhier-mlir b11cd5fa4f3e717374d1e9ba14442ff302d1f970

---
